<title>UK: LME nickel extends losses in PM trading.</title>
<headline>LME nickel extends losses in PM trading.</headline>
<text>
<p>NICKEL - Weaker, extends losses to $7,400 support.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Firmer, hovers under $1,650 in 1st PM ring.</p>
<p>COPPER - Edges higher from morning, but still in negative territory. Cash/threes spread still narrower.</p>
<p>ZINC - Steady.</p>
<p>LEAD - Touch firmer. TIN - Ignored.</p>
</text>
